sequenceDiagram
    participant K as Orchestrator
    participant LB as Load balancer
    participant S as Service
    K->>S: SIGTERM
    Note over S: /readyz now returns 503
    Note over LB: Remove instance from pool
    Note over S: Stop accepting, drain in-flight<br/>requests
    Note over S: Close DB pool, flush logs<br/>and queues
    S-->>K: Exit 0
    Note over K,S: SIGKILL after terminationGracePeriod if still running
